### =============================================================================
### LOCAL - 6. GetRecord ejemplos validos por entidad
### =============================================================================

### Person
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:Persons/UNMSM-166

### OrgUnit - Facultad de Medicina
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:OrgUnits/UNMSM-F1

### Funding - Convocatoria C1
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:Fundings/UNMSM-C1

### Equipment - equipo CTI exportable
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:Equipments/UNMSM-9

### Project - geoLocation normalizado
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:Projects/UNMSM-7368

### Publication - tesis con identificador real
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:Publications/UNMSM-51336

### Patent - patente con IPC real desde view_patente_ipc
GET {{local}}?verb=GetRecord&metadataPrefix={{metadataPrefix}}&identifier=oai:{{oaiDomain}}:Patents/UNMSM-6

